flowchart LR
  M[Merchant] --> A[Authenticated API]
  A -->|short transaction| DB[(Payments, ledger, operations, outbox)]
  DB --> R[Outbox relay]
  R --> K[Kafka lifecycle events]
  K --> C[Idempotent consumers]
  C --> DB
  DB --> W[Leased operation workers]
  W -->|stable provider key| P[Durable provider simulator]
  P --> H[Verified webhook inbox]
  H --> DB
  DB --> RC[Reconciliation]
  RC --> P
  DB --> N[Notification worker]
  N --> MH[Merchant webhook endpoint]
  RD[(Optional Redis limiter)] -. admission only .-> A
